# Pairs with TypeOK. The bump's bound is dropped, so a refusal at the top of the
# epoch domain bumps past it. The bound stands for production's cap on claim
# rounds (LeafAppendEpochFence.MaxClaimRounds), after which the append goes
# unstamped; the mutation checks that the domain bound is real.
MODULE: TypeOkBumpPastEpochDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the claim bump has no room check and leaves the epoch domain
PERTURBS: ClaimBump

--- FIND
    /\ RowHolds(a)
    /\ BumpEpoch <= MaxEpoch
--- REPLACE
    /\ RowHolds(a)
\* MUTATION: no bound on the bump.
--- END
